risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "Optional module attribution is guarded for late Vitest console logs, while unattributed MCP contract drift still fails the reporter."
expected_result: "An entity without a module cannot crash reporting, and missing attribution cannot suppress undeclared MCP warnings."
actual_result: "The absent-module pre-fix control failed and the corrected reporter controls pass, including an otherwise-green run rejected for unknown drift. The initial full suite passes10307 tests with exact source coverage; the unchanged real public workspace matrix and final focused review controls pass. No timeout, allowlist, retry or coverage policy was weakened."
